<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended higher in heavy trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 46.96 points to 7008.99.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 3.32 to 416.94.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.33.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1599 to 942.</p>
<p>Volume was 556,042,370 compared with 547,666,310 on Tuesday.</p>
